    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;If everyone is cheating, no one is cheating.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheaters Cheetah is a multiplayer FPS game where everyone is given <strong>ACTUAL CHEATS</strong> for the game. This includes typical <strong>wallhacks</strong>, <strong>aimbot</strong>, <strong>spinbot</strong>... and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with the help of a former cheat developer (yes, you read that right!), Cheaters Cheetah features a wild array of real-existing cheats. Outsmart and out-cheat your opponents in this one-of-a-kind FPS experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/c171ed2854f5b6d927addbd705ecf8a3.poster.avif?t=1741604289\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/c171ed2854f5b6d927addbd705ecf8a3.webm?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/c171ed2854f5b6d927addbd705ecf8a3.mp4?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash your inner cheetah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallhacks</strong>, <strong>aimbot</strong>, <strong>spinbot</strong>... you name it! All the cheats you know are free to be used in this arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember, your opponents will also have access to the same cheat. This creates a unique dynamic where everyone knows everyone else's position, leading to intense mind games and thrilling battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/1ecf67d730690d65be8f30d75ede1f13.poster.avif?t=1741604289\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/1ecf67d730690d65be8f30d75ede1f13.webm?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/1ecf67d730690d65be8f30d75ede1f13.mp4?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go legit or rage?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your config and dive into the chaos: &quot;Legit cheat&quot; where everyone only has wallhacks, or the &quot;Rage cheat&quot; where every feature is unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic deathmatch to a &quot;Raid boss&quot; mode where multiple legit cheaters team up against 1 rage cheater, Cheaters Cheetah also offers a variety of unique game modes to choose from. The game also features a single player mode, where you can demolish innocent bots as a rage cheater!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BAN those filthy cheetahs with your own hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a prison for former cheaters, who were caught using cheats in a popular online FPS. Transformed into cheetahs, they are forced to participate in a game show &quot;Cheaters Cheetah&quot; as a punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winners will be granted with the &quot;BAN Hammer&quot;, allowing them to BAN all of the losers from the game. Show no mercy to those scumbags!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/d257b369b1de6a97a17b282b4c764c18.poster.avif?t=1741604289\" width=520 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/d257b369b1de6a97a17b282b4c764c18.webm?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438990/extras/d257b369b1de6a97a17b282b4c764c18.mp4?t=1741604289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
